        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 24 at 4:49PM CDT until September 24 at 5:30PM CDT by NWS Midland/Odessa TX</headline>
        <description>At 448 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 10 miles northwest
of Toyah, moving northeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and nickel size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

This severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly rural areas of west
central Reeves County.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
